WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:10.360
Online platforms such as Google and Facebook
can promote groupthink, a mob mentality that

00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:13.639
discourages creativity and individual responsibility.

00:00:13.639 --> 00:00:17.570
You might have noticed that platforms and
websites show you content you already agree

00:00:17.570 --> 00:00:18.570
with.

00:00:18.570 --> 00:00:22.280
It's also evident that groupthink has become
part of the management of these companies.

00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:26.769
For example, Google fired James Damore for
advancing what was called "harmful gender

00:00:26.769 --> 00:00:27.859
stereotypes."

00:00:27.859 --> 00:00:31.099
And Facebook has suppressed news it considered
to be conservative.

00:00:31.099 --> 00:00:35.050
Now, people are calling for the government
to regulate these tech giants.

00:00:35.050 --> 00:00:36.190
That's the wrong approach.

00:00:36.190 --> 00:00:39.950
The First Amendment states that "Congress
shall make no law abridging the freedom of

00:00:39.950 --> 00:00:40.950
speech."

00:00:40.950 --> 00:00:45.900
But for years, regulators have been exacerbating
the problem with policies such as Title II

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:49.300
Net Neutrality, which concentrates power with
online platforms.

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:54.110
To create a marketplace of ideas online, regulators
should remove the barriers to entry which

00:00:54.110 --> 00:00:58.370
limit the ability of other companies to compete
in the online advertising space.

00:00:58.370 --> 00:01:02.740
If forced to compete for ad dollars, Silicon
Valley would have less incentive to placate

00:01:02.740 --> 00:01:07.770
its own bias and the market will have more
meaningful platforms for different kinds of

00:01:07.770 --> 00:01:08.770
speech.

00:01:08.770 --> 00:01:14.170
To learn more about my take on platform competition,
check out the links in the description below.

00:01:14.170 --> 00:01:19.149
Also, let us know what other topics you want
our scholars to cover in 60 seconds, and be

00:01:19.149 --> 00:01:22.630
sure to subscribe for more research and videos
